  <h1 class="page-title">Work With Me</h1>

  <section class="wwm-section">

    <div class="wwm-person">
      <img src="profile.jpg" alt="John McCabe" class="wwm-photo" width="120" height="120">
      <div>
        <div class="wwm-name">John McCabe</div>
        <p class="wwm-who">Last Coin Standing is a one-person project: I choose what to build, do the research, write the words and check the numbers. Before bitcoin, 25 years in product management in Silicon Valley, including Yahoo and Mastercard, and an MBA from Kellogg. More on the <a href="/about">About Me</a> page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="wwm-intro">If something here is useful to you, these are the ways to work with me.</p>

    <p><strong class="wwm-lead-in">A conversation.</strong> If you&rsquo;re thinking through a bitcoin decision, an allocation you&rsquo;re weighing, a drawdown you&rsquo;re planning for, a conversation you want to have with your family or your advisor, I&rsquo;m available for a one-on-one call. These sessions are education, not financial advice: I&rsquo;m not an investment advisor, and I don&rsquo;t make recommendations about securities or any other investment products. What I can do is walk through the tools on this site with your numbers in them and help you leave with a clearer picture of your own reasoning.</p>

    <p><strong class="wwm-lead-in">A collaboration.</strong> If you&rsquo;re an advisor, an asset manager, a firm or a platform, I&rsquo;d like to hear from you: licensing these tools, adapting them for your clients, building investor education together, or something we haven&rsquo;t thought of yet. The tools here are live examples of the work, and of the standard I hold it to: every assumption stated, every figure dated and sourced, and the risks set out next to the case for bitcoin rather than left out of it.</p>

    <p><strong class="wwm-lead-in">A show.</strong> If you&rsquo;d like to cover any of these explorations on a podcast or channel, get in touch and I&rsquo;ll make it easy. I&rsquo;ve been a guest on The Robin Seyr Podcast, Once Bitten! and Bitcoin for Millennials; the episodes are listed on the <a href="/about">About Me</a> page.</p>

    <p class="wwm-closing">To reach me, use the message box below &mdash; it goes straight to me and nothing is ever published &mdash; or email me directly at <a href="mailto:john@lastcoinstanding.com">john@lastcoinstanding.com</a>. My professional background is on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jmccabe1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.</p>

